  values ('west-lake-vinegar-fish', 'West Lake Vinegar Fish', 'West Lake Vinegar Fish', 'hangzhou', 'xihu', 'food', 'Live carp briefly starved, then cooked and served with a sweet-sour vinegar sauce. Quality varies dramatically by restaurant — stick to established old-brand places like Lou Wai Lou or Zhi Wei Guan.', 'Classic', null, null, null, null, null, 'classic-hangzhou-guide.html', 'CN')
